  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;Development for All&apos; Programme - Piaui</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">through the formation of community associations:
 &#xb7;	The acquisition of fertile land 
&#xb7;	Access to clean and safe water
&#xb7;	The construction of adequate housing
&#xb7;	Access to financial and technical support to enable the development of alternative sources of income to improve family incomes
&#xb7;	The introduction of preventative health care through the agency of Pastoral das Criancas.
&#xb7;	The engagement of rural women in the transformation of civil society
&#xb7;	The engagement of all sectors of society, religious and secular, technical and financial, national and international, in the process of development and mutual understanding</narrative>
  </description>
